        },
        {
          "text": "Bakerubi bakalitandabikide maboko aabo kujulu cakuvumbilila cuuno caluzyalo, amasyu aabo akalilangene. Masyu aabakerubi­ akali kulanga cuuno caluzyalo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.9",
